<title>USA: Susa Partnership sets $100 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Susa Partnership sets $100 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Susa Partnership was priced on Monday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER SUSA PARTNERSHIP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.125 PCT  MATURITY 11/01/2003</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.721  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA3  YIELD 7.176 PCT   MAKE-WHOLE-CALL AT 20</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS SPREAD +95 BP     BASIS POINTS</p>
<p>UNDERLYING AUGUST 2003 U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>Corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
